{"id":"H6079","lemma":"עַפְעַף","transliteration":"aphaph","sayIt":"aph-aph","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"noun, masculine","gloss":"eyelid","meaning":"1) eyelid\n1a) eyelid\n1b) of dawn, rays of sun (fig.)","glosses":["eyelids","eyes","breaking","rays","they","fix your gaze"],"count":10,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"job-3","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"the breaking","kjv":"the dawning"}},{"chapterId":"job-16","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"my eyes","kjv":"and on my eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"job-41","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"are like the rays","kjv":"are like the eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"psa-11","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"they","kjv":"his eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"psa-132","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"to my eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"pro-4","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"fix your gaze","kjv":"and let thine eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"pro-6","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"to your eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"pro-6","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"with her eyes"}},{"chapterId":"pro-30","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"are their glances","kjv":"and their eyelids"}},{"chapterId":"jer-9","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"and our eyelids","kjv":"and our eyelids"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Job 3:9","note":"Let the stars of its twilight be dark. Let it look for light, but have none, neither let it see the eyelids of the morning,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 11:4","note":"Yahweh is in his holy temple. Yahweh is on his throne in heaven. His eyes observe. His eyes examine the children of men.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 4:25","note":"Let your eyes look straight ahead. Fix your gaze directly before you.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 9:18","note":"Let them make haste and take up a wailing for us, that our eyes may run down with tears and our eyelids gush out with waters.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}